      },
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.nj4n6o3dvxgr]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00297",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[139].table.rows[1].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25896,
      "endIndex": 25936,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 25856,
        "rowIndex": 1,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "半枝莲 Ban Zhi Lian\u000b[Barbated skullcup herb](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/barbated-skullcup-herb)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00298",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[139].table.rows[1].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 25937,
      "endIndex": 26434,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 25856,
        "rowIndex": 1,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "Traditional reference uses include boils and sores, painful throat swelling and oedema (fluid-related swelling) (PolyU, n.d.-c). In TCM, these applications relate to clearing heat and toxins, resolving blood stasis and promoting urination. Staff-described concerns about unfamiliarity and the need to combine herbs help explain the lower appeal of this raw material compared with prepared products. These are traditional reference uses; no treatment or prescription was observed during the visit.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00299",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[139].table.rows[2].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 26436,
      "endIndex": 26438,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 25856,
        "rowIndex": 2,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.h046qwbci3yc]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00300",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[139].table.rows[2].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 26438,
      "endIndex": 26455,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 25856,
        "rowIndex": 2,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "Specialist herbs",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00301",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[139].table.rows[2].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 26456,
      "endIndex": 26955,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 25856,
        "rowIndex": 2,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "Used as ingredients in a combination selected for a person's TCM pattern, rather than as one uniform product. Preparation may involve selecting compatible ingredients and quantities, then following [instructions for decoction](https://www.cmchk.org.hk/pcm/pdf/guide_retail_e.pdf) (simmering herbs in water). Staff described a need for combination and guidance. Buyers therefore face more decisions and preparation than with preselected soup packs, which helps explain lower demand. The interview did not identify a specific combination or clinical case.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00302",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[139].table.rows[3].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 26957,
      "endIndex": 26959,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 25856,
        "rowIndex": 3,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.9n6912x759c1]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00303",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[139].table.rows[3].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 26959,
      "endIndex": 26985,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 25856,
        "rowIndex": 3,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "大补方\u000bStrong tonic formulas",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00304",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[139].table.rows[3].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 26986,
      "endIndex": 27513,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 25856,
        "rowIndex": 3,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "Intended for more intensive replenishment when an assessed deficiency calls for it; the ingredients and preparation depend on the chosen formula. Staff linked lower appeal to Singapore's hot, humid climate and a preference for lighter qing bu (清补) options. This is a retail interpretation, rather than evidence that every strong tonic is unsuitable locally. Unlike a general food tonic, a medicinal tonic needs selection according to the [person's constitution and condition](https://www.cmro.gov.hk/html/eng/useful_information/public_health/pamphlet/General_Knowledge_of_Taking_Chinese_Medicines.html), adding decisions about suitability and preparation.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00305",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[140]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 27514,
      "endIndex": 27574,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Table A5 Five locally linked examples and production status",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
